{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（14日）早上7時23分，大埔汀角路83號過渡性房屋「樂善村」發生火警，據報一輛電動單車疑充電時起火。消防接報到場救熄，疏散約20人；一名男子</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260514/1131507438663503872456380.jpeg/uYc2gghevDhxYUqsUncvKzBQI_Izy9kQP65HURWuR1E\" alt=\"男傷者的頭髮燒燶，清醒經由救護車送院治理。（翁鈺輝攝）\"><figcaption>男傷者的頭髮燒燶，清醒經由救護車送院治理。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260514/1131507476890390528682035.jpeg/xaGrvi53fqMXftWEEs5dJxrNgoMRvAHI_mSX09Rkl9M\" alt=\"救護員為他戴上氧氣罩。（翁鈺輝攝）\"><figcaption>救護員為他戴上氧氣罩。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260514/1131509117584674816582190.jpeg/neKjMAIU-gXb_BC41V8XkhR1CbzOBL96DQBbJicAWyY\" alt=\"男子清醒送院治理。（翁鈺輝攝）\"><figcaption>男子清醒送院治理。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-14T00:36:53.433523+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":135,"images":3,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}